 R←Test_Misc_015(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;proj;template;collected;titled;ns;overruled;flag;qdmx
⍝ Exercise `CreateReleaseParms` and the optional left argument of `CreateRelease`.
⍝ A stub project is passed, so the test does not depend on open Cider projects.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 proj←⎕NS''
 proj.CiderConfig←⎕NS''
 proj.CiderConfig.HOME←##.CiderConfig.HOME
 proj.CiderConfig.CIDER←⎕NS''
 proj.CiderConfig.CIDER.project_url←'https://github.com/aplteam/GitHub'
 proj.CiderConfig.CIDER.distributionFolder←'Dist'

 ⍝ A release is not a package, so neither of these has any business being here:
 template←##.GitHub.CreateReleaseParms
 →T.PassesIf~(⊂'description')∊template.⎕NL ¯2
 →T.PassesIf~(⊂'license')∊template.⎕NL ¯2
 →T.PassesIf 1=template.draft                  ⍝ Nothing goes public by accident

 ⍝ What is collected must have exactly the shape the template describes:
 collected←##.GitHub.CreateRelease proj
 →T.PassesIf(template.⎕NL ¯2)≡collected.⎕NL ¯2

 ⍝ A simple text vector as ⍺ is the title, and nothing else changes:
 titled←'Long awaited spring release'##.GitHub.CreateRelease proj
 →T.PassesIf'Long awaited spring release'≡titled.releaseTitle
 →T.PassesIf titled.version≡collected.version
 →T.PassesIf titled.tag≡collected.tag

 ⍝ A namespace as ⍺ beats what was collected, but only where it says something:
 ns←⎕NS''
 ns.releaseTitle←'Hand-written title'
 ns.draft←0
 overruled←ns ##.GitHub.CreateRelease proj
 →T.PassesIf'Hand-written title'≡overruled.releaseTitle
 →T.PassesIf 0=overruled.draft
 →T.PassesIf overruled.version≡collected.version   ⍝ Untouched, so still collected
 →T.PassesIf overruled.assets≡collected.assets

 ⍝ An empty namespace is fine: it insists on nothing, so nothing changes.
 overruled←(⎕NS'')##.GitHub.CreateRelease proj
 →T.PassesIf overruled.releaseTitle≡collected.releaseTitle
 →T.PassesIf overruled.draft≡collected.draft

 ⍝ A name that is not a release parameter must be refused rather than ignored:
 flag←0
 ns←⎕NS''
 ns.nonsense←42
 :Trap 11                           ⍝ Not gated on stopFlag: catching this IS the test
     {}ns ##.GitHub.CreateRelease proj
 :Else
     qdmx←⎕DMX
     flag←∨/'nonsense'⍷qdmx.EM
 :EndTrap
 →T.PassesIf flag

 ⍝ …and so must a left argument that is neither text nor a namespace:
 flag←0
 :Trap 11                           ⍝ Not gated on stopFlag: catching this IS the test
     {}(1 2 3)##.GitHub.CreateRelease proj
 :Else
     qdmx←⎕DMX
     flag←1
 :EndTrap
 →T.PassesIf flag

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
